# ---------------------------------------------------
# FPGA & VLSI Project .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------

# 1. Simulation Artifacts (Icarus Verilog / ModelSim / Vivado Sim)
*.vcd
*.out
*.vvp
*.wlf
transcript
modelsim.ini
work/
sim_build/
xsim.dir/
*.pb

# 2. Xilinx Vivado Specific Artifacts
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.dmp
.Xil/
*.cache/
*.hw/
*.ip_user_files/
*.runs/
*.sim/
*.xpr
*.os
# (Optional) If you want to keep the block design but ignore the wrappers:
# *.bd

# 3. Bitstreams and Programming Files (Compiled Hardware)
# Note: Keep these out of source control. Upload them to GitHub 'Releases' instead.
*.bit
*.bin
*.mcs
*.prm
*.sysdef
*.hdf
*.xsa

# 4. Synthesis and Implementation Reports
# If you want to share specific reports in your docs/ folder, manually add them.
# Otherwise, ignore auto-generated ones.
*.rpt
*.mrp
*.srp
*.timing

# 5. OS Generated Files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db